\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  Natl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  Again; No Threat To Reserves \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Mai 1999\par 12:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  PRAGUE (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  National Bank is confident that its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the koruna won't jeopardize its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, even though it was again forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, an official told Dow Jones Newswires. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  after domestic corporate clients sent the koruna to a record low at SKK47.400 against the euro from SKK46.900 late Tuesday, as they continued to hedge against the further koruna weakening, said Frantisek Szulenyi, head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The volumes we have used so far aren't too large," Szulenyi said. "We purchased some foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the domestic market in February and we still have by far not returned that amount." \par \par \uc2  Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  shortly after 0830 GMT, but at 1000 GMT, the koruna was still quoted at SKK47.300-SKK47.500, a dealer at ING Barings said. \par \par \uc2  "I think (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again. The amount they used was insufficient. And the outflow (of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) continues," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  According to Szulenyi, the bank didn't use more than $40 million in total in its recent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Dealers said Wednesday, the bank didn't use more than $10 million. \par \par \uc2  The Slovak market is small and often illiquid, and koruna levels can change sharply on single trades. According to dealers in Bratislava, the koruna has been falling dramatically over the past weeks as the foreign investors are sidelined and domestic corporate customers have sold in a panic. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the recent falls in the koruna reflect the delay in the implementation of economic reforms promised by the government after it took office in November. This has been exacerbated, however, by political uncertainty as Slovakia is facing the first-ever runoff in direct presidential elections end of May, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 19-05-99 \par \par \uc2  1021GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5j03tmq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
