\par\par \b \uc2  Slovank c.bank says no need for  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 1999\par 14:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, May 12 (Reuters) - The director of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  asset department, Frantisek Szulenyi, told Reuters on Wednesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw no need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the crown market at the moment. \par \par \uc2  "At the moment, the volatility does not seem such that it would be necessary to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Szulenyi said. "I think it is not comparable to what we had here in March. It was a lot stronger then." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying crowns early in March when low interest rates led to a sharp weakening. \par \par \uc2  "The monetary programme says we will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  against trends," said Szulenyi.. "We are monitoring the exchange rate and we will see what happens...If it is necessary, we are ready to correct developments." \par \par \uc2  Szulenyi said the market was illiquid and was being moved by very small trades. Dealers said earlier that the decline may have been partly due to the situation in Russia, where President Boris Yeltisn sacked Premier Yevgeny Primakov earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  The Slovak crown weakened to record lows on Wednesday. It was quoted at 45.40/48 to the euro at 1205 GMT, from 45.17/27 at the open. ((Andrej Salner, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax 421-7-5341-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv5c012vl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
