\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to stabilise crown. \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 14:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRATISLAVA, March 9 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday said it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for crowns after the crown dipped sharply in mid-morning trading. \par \par \uc2  "For the first time since the (October 1998) flotation of the crown, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," the director of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  asset department, Frantisek Szulenyi, told Reuters on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said earlier it had sold two-three day T-bills from its own portfolio for the first time to set a lower limit for short term interest rates, which have fallen sharply in recent days. \par \par \uc2  The Slovak crown came under selling pressure before midday, falling to 44.7/0 to the euro from opening levels of 43.89/98. It later rebounded to around 44.15. \par \par \uc2  "We had information from the market that there was no great foreign speculation behind it (the fall in the crown) just market illiquidity," Szulenyi said. \par \par \uc2  "The volume of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was minimal. It was neither hundreds nor tens of millions of euros," he added. \par \par \uc2  Szulenyi said there were no fundamental reasons for the volatility. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has indicated in the past it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to calm the market and prevent wide fluctuations not based on fundamentals, but it is not known to have any target for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Szulenyi said the market now looked calmer but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was ready to move again if deemed necessary. \par \par \uc2  ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5341-8402, fax, 421-7-5341-8403 bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv39073cj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
