the former basket parity. \par \par \uc2  - The state debt is being paid by the \b \highlight22\uc2 ministry of finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  but only up to a level which will ensure it does not exceed the declared state deficit of eight billion crowns. \par \par \uc2  PRACA - The sale of Slovenske Elektrarne and Slovensky Plynarensky Priemysel is to be expected, the vice chairman of SDL Brigitra Schmognerova said after the talks with representatives of the National Property Fund (FNM). \par \par \uc2  - The employees of machinery company ZTS TEES Martin as well as other subsidiaries of OZ KOVO are on strike alert. ((Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402, fax 421-7-521-8403, bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113duaf01xtf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
