\par\par \b \uc2  East Europe  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 /Wobble -3: Slovakia Seen Vulnerable \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Mai 1997\par 19:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Market participants in Bucharest also saw little threat of fallout from the koruna's troubles. \par \par \uc2  'The koruna won't have even the most minor effect on the leu,' said one trader at a foreign bank in Bucharest. 'The economies are in different shapes, and they attract different types of investors.' \par \par \uc2  He added that Romania will hold foreign investors' interest in coming weeks as the government prepares to eliminate restrictions on repatriation of foreign portfolio investment. \par \par \uc2  Ion Dragolin, monetary-policy director at the National Bank of Romania, also denied that the koruna's troubles would affect the leu. He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought more than $800 million in hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on local markets since January in order to prevent the leu from rising sharply as a result of increased foreign investment and tight monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  But onlookers were less sanguine about the Slovak koruna's prospects. \par \par \uc2  Late Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading on the weak side of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  National Bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. The band permits the koruna to fluctuate within 7% on either side of its midpoint against a basket of 60% mark and 40% dollar. \par \par \uc2  'The range of bid prices is 1% to 7% on the weak side of the band,' said Tibor Fratrik, chief dealer at ING Bank in Bratislava. 'There's no liquidity. You can't really predict what will happen on this market more than three hours in the future.' \par \par \uc2  A spokesman for the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  told Dow Jones Tuesday that its monetary policy 'remains stable' and hasn't changed. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-05-97 \par \par \uc2  1750GMT \par \par \uc2  1193 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5r03x55\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
