\par\par \b \uc2  Slovak Koruna Falls -2: 'Massive' Pressure Seen In Market \b0\par\par\uc2 189 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Mai 1997\par 17:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Gerhard Krause, economist at Deutsche Morgan Grenfell in Frankfurt, called the pressure on the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  'massive.' \par \par \uc2  Krause said late Tuesday that one bank in Bratislava was quoting the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  koruna on the weak side of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 7.2% from the midpoint, a point technically outside the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  But Krause noted that other banks quoted the \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's limit, and said the reason for the lone discrepancy was unclear. \par \par \uc2  Also unclear, market players said, is how the market will react to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's hands-off approach. \par \par \uc2  'I don't think they're really facing reality,' Krause said, noting that Slovakia's widening current account deficit and close ties to the Czech economy endanger the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  He said that despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's moves last week to lift minimum limits on the size of transactions, thereby draining liquidity from the market and hindering speculation, 'there's still more reason to speculate against the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  than against the Czech \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-05-97 \par \par \uc2  1536GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5r03wii\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\p